      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "They're on the FAQ, but less prominently linked than they used to be because we're something like 5 printings and 3 years past the affected editions:\n\n* [List of errors and typos in core game 4th/5th printings](https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!Core-game-4th-printing-errors-and-typos)\n* [List of errors and typos in Branch & Claw 3rd printing](https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!Branch-and-Claw-3rd-printing-errors-and-typos)\n* [List of contents of the Errata Pack for the above](https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!Errata-Pack-Core-4th5th-BC-3rd) (fixes all game-significant errors and the more egregious-prominent typos)\n\nNote that **only the 4th and 5th printings of the core game need the errata pack**, and that **the 6th printing sneakily masquerades as the 5th printing** ([here's how to tell them apart)](https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.bu6ocbc). Ordering an errata pack you don't need will cost Greater Than Games money, and will make someone who *does* need an errata pack very sad when they sell out.",
